{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Williams\u2122 Pinball classics are now available -- and Fish Tales\u2122 is yours for FREE! Zen is proud to bring these amazing games to players around the world. Enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball FX Classic is the biggest, most community focused pinball game ever created. Multiplayer matchups, user generated tournaments and league play create endless opportunity for pinball competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE backwards compatibility! Bring your previous Pinball FX2 purchases with you to Pinball FX Classic at no charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not so hot with the flippers? Pinball FX Classic features new single player modes that will help you become a better player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tables have received graphics updates including real-time lighting and shadow projection.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nine zeros","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/897f420fe4a661c490b6666e8314f562faf130a3.jpg"},{"name":"Contender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/2d4b5ea2c992a1b8c906daec7f1ecb174728588c.jpg"},{"name":"Beat this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/917d699ce524d6c9717e30d3a8a5e41698b49395.jpg"},{"name":"Master of pinballs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/ca17a04587a6b03e1ced437f5fe4f9c23c7060f6.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta collect'em all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/691cdd1ed7ef789a3843b0d08b378780cf64b711.jpg"},{"name":"Get the stars!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/442120/e69bb18fb64b3b7e86c9cbcab071595862c6c77c.jpg"},{"name":"Here comes a new challe